# SwiftPM
.build/
Packages/
Package.pins
# Package.resolved is deliberately tracked. ShellCraft is an application,
# not a library, and it now embeds Sparkle -- the framework that installs
# updates on users' machines. Leaving the resolution floating meant a
# release could ship a different Sparkle than the one that was tested.


